# Global gitignore — wired up via:
#   git config --global core.excludesFile ~/.gitignore_global
#
# This file is never committed to any repository. It keeps AI-tooling config out
# of every repo on this machine without putting a revealing line in any project's
# own .gitignore (which IS committed, and would advertise exactly what this is
# meant to keep private).
#
# Applies to every repo automatically, including ones cloned at a future job.

